  "fingers": {
   "confidence": "drawing",
   "note": "drawing - the top view: nine fingers a row, the middle seven on a 53.9 mm pitch with the middle one on the middle of the duct, 19.5 wide, and the two end fingers centred 207.8 from the middle at mid-length. The end fingers are swept toward the middle in the top view; they are drawn straight, centred 202.15 from the middle so that their 32 mm tips end flush with the ends of the duct, 5.65 inside where their mid-length reads."
  },
