   "note": "FIGURES FROM THE VENDOR DRAWING. The FS 1&2RU Horizontal Single Sided Manager datasheet (USCMH-SFDABS1U and -2U) has a specification table and, per model, a top view, a front view and a side view in millimetres. Rendered at 600 dpi, the front view is 4.28 px/mm across the 482.22 and 4.38 down the 44.3, 2 per cent apart, and the top view 4.26 across and 4.27 down its 97.00, so both carry geometry to about a millimetre. The side view does not: its 65.81 dimension reads 4.35 px/mm along the depth, but its height reads 58.5 mm against the 44.3 of the front view, so nothing is taken up its height. The renders of #317015 on the FS product page are the second reading; gallery image 5 is the front with the cover off."
